# Ensalada De Antipasto Asado

Based on [https://savorrecipes.com/recipe/ensalada-de-antipasto-asado/](https://savorrecipes.com/recipe/ensalada-de-antipasto-asado/)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Roasted Components

- [ ] 16 oz [cherry tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" }
- [ ] 4 cloves [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 1 cup [roasted red peppers]{ ing="roasted-red-peppers" }, sliced
- [ ] 1 cup [mixed olives]{ ing="mixed-olives" }
- [ ] 1 cup [salami or pepperoni]{ ing="salami-or-pepperoni" }, diced
- [ ] 2 Tbsps [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } (divided)
- [ ] Pinch of [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] Pinch of [black pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }
- [ ] Pinch of [red pepper flakes]{ ing="red-pepper-flakes" }
- [ ] 5 oz [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } with garlic and herbs

### Salad

- [ ] 8 cups [romaine lettuce]{ ing="romaine-lettuce" }, chopped
- [ ] 1 cup [mozzarella balls]{ ing="mozzarella-balls" }
- [ ] 1 cup [provolone cheese]{ ing="provolone-cheese" }, cubed
- [ ] 1/2 [lemon]{ ing="lemon" }

## Recipe

1. Preheat oven to 400°F. In a 9x13-inch baking dish, combine [tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" }, [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, [roasted red peppers]{ ing="roasted-red-peppers" }, [olives]{ ing="mixed-olives" }, salami, 1 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }, [salt]{ ing="salt" }, [black pepper]{ ing="black-pepper" }, and [red pepper flakes]{ ing="red-pepper-flakes" }.
1. Place [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } in the center of the mixture and drizzle the top with remaining [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }.
1. Bake for 40 minutes until [tomatoes]{ ing="cherry-tomatoes" } burst and [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } softens.
1. Remove from oven and stir to incorporate the [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } throughout the mixture.
1. In a large bowl, combine [romaine lettuce]{ ing="romaine-lettuce" }, [mozzarella balls]{ ing="mozzarella-balls" }, and [provolone cheese]{ ing="provolone-cheese" }. Pour the warm mixture over the greens. Finish with [lemon]{ ing="lemon" } juice and toss to combine.

## Notes

- Prep Time: 10 minutes
- Cook Time: 40 minutes
- Serves: 8
